"suspend, interrupt mask, allocation or live painting is performed. Worst-case"
" work is words*sizeof(StackType_t) byte reads. Paint is the locked kernel's "
"0xA5. Untouched/touched bytes do not prove physical stack peaks. The POSIX "
"kernel port uses a separate pthread execution stack; its query is not an MCU "
"or Linux execution-stack peak measurement."

