#: docs/reference/api/os.md:114
msgid ""
"Task-only; follows nx_wait_until's arm/recheck and deadline contract. Each "
"scan visits at most count predicates, wrapping from start, with no allocation"
" or retained registration. A ready source does not grant ownership or consume"
" its event; the caller must acquire/try the real operation. Advance the next "
"call's start explicitly to choose fairness. The caller connects source "
"notifications to this port, maintains the authoritative predicates, and "
"stops/joins publishers and waiters before reclaiming their state. No worker, "
"dispatch, subscription, automatic unregister or service is implicit. Errors "
"preserve selected unless caller callbacks change it."
msgstr ""
"Task-only; follows nx_wait_until's arm/recheck and deadline contract. Each "
"scan visits at most count predicates, wrapping from start, with no allocation"
" or retained registration. A ready source does not grant ownership or consume"
" its event; the caller must acquire/try the real operation. Advance the next "
"call's start explicitly to choose fairness. The caller connects source "
"notifications to this port, maintains the authoritative predicates, and "
"stops/joins publishers and waiters before reclaiming their state. No worker, "
"dispatch, subscription, automatic unregister or service is implicit. Errors "
"preserve selected unless caller callbacks change it."

