#: docs/reference/api/os.md:114
msgid ""
"ready runs in the waiting caller's context and must be bounded. Observe real "
"state with its required synchronization; do not service a controller or "
"mutate this source array. Context may be NULL if the predicate permits it. "
"Source configuration and context remain valid throughout selection."
msgstr ""
"ready runs in the waiting caller's context and must be bounded. Observe real "
"state with its required synchronization; do not service a controller or "
"mutate this source array. Context may be NULL if the predicate permits it. "
"Source configuration and context remain valid throughout selection."
